(6910529, 1041952, 118154, '<td valign="top">Have you been studying<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jagar</a>.Can''t say I blame you,Nice image.</td>', 'Have you been studying Jagar.Can''t say I blame you,Nice image.', '2012-11-21 08:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910530, 1041827, 124815, '<td valign="top">powerful</td>', 'powerful', '2012-11-21 08:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910531, 1041824, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not very HC but who cares I love the processing here.(and the model)</td>', 'Not very HC but who cares I love the processing here.(and the model)', '2012-11-21 08:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910537, 1041884, 124815, '<td valign="top">Superb photo. Molto cantabile.<br/>The shadow of the eye lashes, the hair, the hand movement ... composition ,,, splendid!</td>', 'Superb photo. Molto cantabile.The shadow of the eye lashes, the hair, the hand movement ... composition ,,, splendid!', '2012-11-21 08:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910551, 1041733, 153814, '<td valign="top">Yes yes yes. Great shot simple yet effective.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Yes yes yes. Great shot simple yet effective.Well done.', '2012-11-21 09:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910552, 1041920, 153814, '<td valign="top">Good job on this well done.<br/>This image makes ya think.</td>', 'Good job on this well done.This image makes ya think.', '2012-11-21 09:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910555, 1041671, 153814, '<td valign="top">Nice one I see lots of people going with the black and white so I guess it''s harder to do the contrast shots in color. You did it, this is one of my top picks and I applaud you for going with the color.<br/></td>', 'Nice one I see lots of people going with the black and white so I guess it''s harder to do the contrast shots in color. You did it, this is one of my top picks and I applaud you for going with the color.', '2012-11-21 09:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910557, 1041472, 153814, '<td valign="top">Don''t tell anyone but I''m not a big fan of pet or kid shots BUT this is great. This fits the challenge to a "T" and I love the expression on the cats face.<br/>I also think it''s cool that you have a black and white image that''s in color. I don''t know if that makes any sence but I like it. Well done.</td>', 'Don''t tell anyone but I''m not a big fan of pet or kid shots BUT this is great. This fits the challenge to a "T" and I love the expression on the cats face.I also think it''s cool that you have a black and white image that''s in color. I don''t know if that makes any sence but I like it. Well done.', '2012-11-21 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910559, 1041455, 153814, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image that fits the challenge well.<br/>I like this I hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice crisp image that fits the challenge well.I like this I hope it does well.', '2012-11-21 09:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910561, 1041879, 153814, '<td valign="top">Cool shot it almost looks 3D. <br/>I really like the detail in this.</td>', 'Cool shot it almost looks 3D. I really like the detail in this.', '2012-11-21 09:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910564, 1041891, 153814, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that you have to keep coming back to.<br/>It''s impossible to look at this and not smile.<br/>Great shot &amp; perfect timing.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'This is one of those images that you have to keep coming back to.It''s impossible to look at this and not smile.Great shot & perfect timing.Well done.', '2012-11-21 09:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910567, 1041685, 153814, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, good job on this.<br/>It''s seems simple but there is alot to see here.</td>', 'Cool shot, good job on this.It''s seems simple but there is alot to see here.', '2012-11-21 09:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910570, 1041801, 153814, '<td valign="top">Aaaaaaarg. This image is right there. Your killing me. This is the image everyone wants to take but it seems just a tad out of focus.<br/>If this image was sharp it''s blue ribbon caliber.<br/>I hope it does well for ya.</td>', 'Aaaaaaarg. This image is right there. Your killing me. This is the image everyone wants to take but it seems just a tad out of focus.If this image was sharp it''s blue ribbon caliber.I hope it does well for ya.', '2012-11-21 09:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910582, 1041785, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a nice starting point. You showed some good compositional elements by placing an object in the foreground and using the leading line of the shoreline to lead to the foggy hillside in the background. A few ideas to bring it to the next level would include, shooting at a lower viewpoint using a landscape orientation, then in post processing use separate gradient filters to bring down the exposure of the sky to show the contrasty clouds, raise the exposure of the foreground to show the highlights in the water, and use a layer mask to exposing the land a little higher than the water.</td>', 'This is a nice starting point. You showed some good compositional elements by placing an object in the foreground and using the leading line of the shoreline to lead to the foggy hillside in the background. A few ideas to bring it to the next level would include, shooting at a lower viewpoint using a landscape orientation, then in post processing use separate gradient filters to bring down the exposure of the sky to show the contrasty clouds, raise the exposure of the foreground to show the highlights in the water, and use a layer mask to exposing the land a little higher than the water.', '2012-11-21 10:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910584, 1041856, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am voting this a 6 for great emotion. I am seeing either camera shake due to use of slow shutter speed which leaves motion blur, or a missed focus with wide open aperture and a lack of anything sharp, including the background which isn''t moving.</td>', 'I am voting this a 6 for great emotion. I am seeing either camera shake due to use of slow shutter speed which leaves motion blur, or a missed focus with wide open aperture and a lack of anything sharp, including the background which isn''t moving.', '2012-11-21 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910604, 1042012, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. The blur/purple creates a nice contrast of color against the orange overtones.</td>', 'Lovely colors. The blur/purple creates a nice contrast of color against the orange overtones.', '2012-11-21 10:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910605, 1041774, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait, and perfectly focused for an action that I know is hard to capture well.</td>', 'Very cute portrait, and perfectly focused for an action that I know is hard to capture well.', '2012-11-21 10:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910606, 1041956, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of portrait orientation to create scale.</td>', 'Excellent use of portrait orientation to create scale.', '2012-11-21 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910607, 1041873, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen. Looks like the sky opened up so the sun is just shining on the bird.</td>', 'Nicely seen. Looks like the sky opened up so the sun is just shining on the bird.', '2012-11-21 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910608, 1042018, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. I think you could have tweaked it to increase the contrast a bit more, but it''s good.</td>', 'I like this. I think you could have tweaked it to increase the contrast a bit more, but it''s good.', '2012-11-21 10:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910609, 1041906, 114225, '<td valign="top">Guess I''m missing the high contrast in this one. I see some pockets of high contrast (like the suit) but overall it feels like this just has normal contrasts.</td>', 'Guess I''m missing the high contrast in this one. I see some pockets of high contrast (like the suit) but overall it feels like this just has normal contrasts.', '2012-11-21 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910611, 1041472, 114225, '<td valign="top">With a bit brighter white (maybe use some dodging) this could have worked much better.</td>', 'With a bit brighter white (maybe use some dodging) this could have worked much better.', '2012-11-21 10:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910612, 1041952, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of noire style light.</td>', 'Very nice use of noire style light.', '2012-11-21 10:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910613, 1041958, 114225, '<td valign="top">I must say, I wasn''t expecting to see anything like this. It''s repulsive and inviting at the same time.</td>', 'I must say, I wasn''t expecting to see anything like this. It''s repulsive and inviting at the same time.', '2012-11-21 11:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910614, 1041948, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of high key in the skin but keeping the dark parts dark. This is a great use of contrast to direct the viewers'' eyes.</td>', 'Lovely use of high key in the skin but keeping the dark parts dark. This is a great use of contrast to direct the viewers'' eyes.', '2012-11-21 11:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910615, 1041817, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was guessing we would get an eclipse shot in this. Perfect opportunity and wonderfully taken image.</td>', 'I was guessing we would get an eclipse shot in this. Perfect opportunity and wonderfully taken image.', '2012-11-21 11:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910616, 1041620, 114225, '<td valign="top">The black leather with the shadow says so much about the character of the girl and the photo.</td>', 'The black leather with the shadow says so much about the character of the girl and the photo.', '2012-11-21 11:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910617, 1041703, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo in the details and message.</td>', 'Beautiful photo in the details and message.', '2012-11-21 11:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910618, 1042011, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of nature. These pops provide some nice photographic opportunities, especially in black and white as you have chosen here.</td>', 'Very nice use of nature. These pops provide some nice photographic opportunities, especially in black and white as you have chosen here.', '2012-11-21 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910620, 1041557, 114225, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I have ever seen a fork bleed before.<br/> <br/>This needs to be a touch brighter to really have some high contrast.</td>', 'I don''t think I have ever seen a fork bleed before. This needs to be a touch brighter to really have some high contrast.', '2012-11-21 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910622, 1041532, 114225, '<td valign="top">The shirt is was makes this good in my opinion. That is what takes the black and white contrast up a level.</td>', 'The shirt is was makes this good in my opinion. That is what takes the black and white contrast up a level.', '2012-11-21 11:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910623, 1041641, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Jagar photo to me. Great use of shadows to create the contrast, but there is also some old vs new in here that adds an extra level of contrast.</td>', 'Looks like a Jagar photo to me. Great use of shadows to create the contrast, but there is also some old vs new in here that adds an extra level of contrast.', '2012-11-21 11:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910624, 1041884, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the photo idea. I''m seeing a lot of mid tone greys (and obviously blacks) but no bright whites to give this high contrast.</td>', 'I like the photo idea. I''m seeing a lot of mid tone greys (and obviously blacks) but no bright whites to give this high contrast.', '2012-11-21 11:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910626, 1041556, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting techniques. I think if there were some more highlights (everything seems to be in the low and mid tonal ranges) that this would have better contrast.</td>', 'Great use of lighting techniques. I think if there were some more highlights (everything seems to be in the low and mid tonal ranges) that this would have better contrast.', '2012-11-21 11:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910627, 1041856, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute capture of a fun moment. My eyes are looks for some really sharp details, but not finding them likely because of some subject movement.</td>', 'Cute capture of a fun moment. My eyes are looks for some really sharp details, but not finding them likely because of some subject movement.', '2012-11-21 11:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910629, 1041379, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent! A friend of mine takes these types of street portraits and they always have high contrast and look great. This is on that same level.</td>', 'Excellent! A friend of mine takes these types of street portraits and they always have high contrast and look great. This is on that same level.', '2012-11-21 11:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910630, 1041838, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful representation. Very soothing effect.</td>', 'This is a beautiful representation. Very soothing effect.', '2012-11-21 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910632, 1042027, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo with great details and color pop.</td>', 'Very nice photo with great details and color pop.', '2012-11-21 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910633, 1041628, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love this subject and the perspective you used. But it seems to have all tones in the low range making it a low key instead of a high contrast photo.</td>', 'Love this subject and the perspective you used. But it seems to have all tones in the low range making it a low key instead of a high contrast photo.', '2012-11-21 11:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910636, 1041772, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. It has a classic feel to it.</td>', 'I like this. It has a classic feel to it.', '2012-11-21 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910637, 1041919, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing photo. The smoke really makes the mid stir and the imagination come to life.</td>', 'This is an intriguing photo. The smoke really makes the mid stir and the imagination come to life.', '2012-11-21 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910641, 1041994, 149281, '<td valign="top">Pileated Woodpecker. The inspiration for  Woody the Woodpecker.  Great shot.</td>', 'Pileated Woodpecker. The inspiration for  Woody the Woodpecker.  Great shot.', '2012-11-21 11:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910642, 1041808, 149281, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2012-11-21 11:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910660, 1041870, 118154, '<td valign="top">I''m in love with so many shots this time.8.</td>', 'I''m in love with so many shots this time.8.', '2012-11-21 11:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6910663, 1042020, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2012-11-21 11:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
