(6911195, 1041919, 119863, '<td valign="top">Interested in how this was made</td>', 'Interested in how this was made', '2012-11-22 03:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911196, 1042012, 119863, '<td valign="top">The pastel-like texture on the building faces feel like overuse of noise reduction and the brightening of the sky left pretty undesirable artifacts.  Exciting fountain, but over-processed I think.</td>', 'The pastel-like texture on the building faces feel like overuse of noise reduction and the brightening of the sky left pretty undesirable artifacts.  Exciting fountain, but over-processed I think.', '2012-11-22 03:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911197, 1041781, 119863, '<td valign="top">To get away from the photographer</td>', 'To get away from the photographer', '2012-11-22 03:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911198, 1041883, 119863, '<td valign="top">Looks like a crime scene photo</td>', 'Looks like a crime scene photo', '2012-11-22 03:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911199, 1041904, 119863, '<td valign="top">like a sexual rorschach</td>', 'like a sexual rorschach', '2012-11-22 03:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911200, 1041906, 119863, '<td valign="top">ugh, so processed.</td>', 'ugh, so processed.', '2012-11-22 03:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911202, 1041388, 119863, '<td valign="top">...is something not portrayed in this photograph.</td>', '...is something not portrayed in this photograph.', '2012-11-22 03:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911250, 1041955, 47316, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. The dress is gorgeous, and the contrast really works here. Honestly, I would have left out the umbrella. It distracts and doesn''t really work with the dress. Would have to be an old lacy one to fit I think... or perhaps burn it enough so it''s darker and you can''t see all the sags and wrinkles. PS. The title immediately put a song in my head. Infinity by Inara George. I find it fitting.</td>', 'Lovely photo. The dress is gorgeous, and the contrast really works here. Honestly, I would have left out the umbrella. It distracts and doesn''t really work with the dress. Would have to be an old lacy one to fit I think... or perhaps burn it enough so it''s darker and you can''t see all the sags and wrinkles. PS. The title immediately put a song in my head. Infinity by Inara George. I find it fitting.', '2012-11-22 08:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911252, 1041294, 47316, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get what you were going for here. It doesn''t really make sense to me to shoot a horror shot, portrait style. These kinds of shots need a setting that fits. Also the whites are so blown out that you''ve lost too much detail for my taste. Her whole pinky finger is gone.</td>', 'I don''t really get what you were going for here. It doesn''t really make sense to me to shoot a horror shot, portrait style. These kinds of shots need a setting that fits. Also the whites are so blown out that you''ve lost too much detail for my taste. Her whole pinky finger is gone.', '2012-11-22 08:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911253, 1041437, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of a very thoughtful and poised bird, but it doesn''t seem to have much contrast. Black and white and bump the contrast this may have been pretty cool.</td>', 'This is a great shot of a very thoughtful and poised bird, but it doesn''t seem to have much contrast. Black and white and bump the contrast this may have been pretty cool.', '2012-11-22 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911254, 1041824, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty soft colors, though I think the sepia reduces the impact of a high contrast feel. I think backing the scarf off her her eyes just a bit would have helped too, her face seems too crowded in to me.</td>', 'Pretty soft colors, though I think the sepia reduces the impact of a high contrast feel. I think backing the scarf off her her eyes just a bit would have helped too, her face seems too crowded in to me.', '2012-11-22 08:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911255, 1041738, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cool! I''m a sucker for negative space images that work.</td>', 'Cool! I''m a sucker for negative space images that work.', '2012-11-22 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911256, 1042011, 47316, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures. An interesting subject well captured. Just a note, maybe this is my stuffy, esoteric side (read: possibly snooty) speaking out but I think I''d prefer a less straightforward title. :)</td>', 'Lovely textures. An interesting subject well captured. Just a note, maybe this is my stuffy, esoteric side (read: possibly snooty) speaking out but I think I''d prefer a less straightforward title. :)', '2012-11-22 08:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911258, 1041524, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nice study of shape and texture.</td>', 'Nice study of shape and texture.', '2012-11-22 08:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911259, 1042025, 47316, '<td valign="top">I dig it! I really like how it took me a second to even realize what I was looking at, there were such interesting shapes created.</td>', 'I dig it! I really like how it took me a second to even realize what I was looking at, there were such interesting shapes created.', '2012-11-22 08:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911260, 1041884, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very lovely portrait!  Emotive, well lit, just great.</td>', 'Very lovely portrait!  Emotive, well lit, just great.', '2012-11-22 08:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911261, 1041794, 47316, '<td valign="top">What a cutey. I really like the colors here.</td>', 'What a cutey. I really like the colors here.', '2012-11-22 08:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911262, 1041908, 47316, '<td valign="top">Well it is certainly high contrast but I think there isn''t much going for this shot. The contrast is too much, it seems out of focus to my eye, and what sort of celebrations are expressed here? It''s just a single candle.</td>', 'Well it is certainly high contrast but I think there isn''t much going for this shot. The contrast is too much, it seems out of focus to my eye, and what sort of celebrations are expressed here? It''s just a single candle.', '2012-11-22 08:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911264, 1041388, 47316, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why the focus is on the background and not the rose? It doesn''t work.</td>', 'I don''t understand why the focus is on the background and not the rose? It doesn''t work.', '2012-11-22 08:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911307, 1041952, 122678, '<td valign="top">Your image is beautiful. What a wonderful idea for high contrast, a nice surprise among all the others. Good Luck!</td>', 'Your image is beautiful. What a wonderful idea for high contrast, a nice surprise among all the others. Good Luck!', '2012-11-22 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911308, 1041858, 122678, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, beautiful child with a beautiful smile to match!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, beautiful child with a beautiful smile to match!', '2012-11-22 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911309, 1041538, 122678, '<td valign="top">My favorite shot in this challenge. Perfect in every way, a winner! Good Luck!</td>', 'My favorite shot in this challenge. Perfect in every way, a winner! Good Luck!', '2012-11-22 11:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911311, 1041891, 61396, '<td valign="top">Lovely teeth, and a great moment to capture.</td>', 'Lovely teeth, and a great moment to capture.', '2012-11-22 11:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911395, 1041929, 69325, '<td valign="top">oh god, a hummingbird shot,we''re all screwed now :)</td>', 'oh god, a hummingbird shot,we''re all screwed now :)', '2012-11-22 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911411, 1041379, 140305, '<td valign="top">The thing I like about this photograph (besides the contrast between the bright whites and the deep blacks) is the contrast in texture. There''s a lot going on with that and to me it give it a lot of "feel". Nice focus. 8</td>', 'The thing I like about this photograph (besides the contrast between the bright whites and the deep blacks) is the contrast in texture. There''s a lot going on with that and to me it give it a lot of "feel". Nice focus. 8', '2012-11-22 14:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911413, 1041552, 140305, '<td valign="top">Cowboys are great subjects for sure. I like this a lot, only thing that is a bit distracting to me is the branches under his left arm. Wish they were''nt there, but overall a very nice photo.</td>', 'Cowboys are great subjects for sure. I like this a lot, only thing that is a bit distracting to me is the branches under his left arm. Wish they were''nt there, but overall a very nice photo.', '2012-11-22 14:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911415, 1041679, 140305, '<td valign="top">Really interesting composition.</td>', 'Really interesting composition.', '2012-11-22 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911417, 1041919, 140305, '<td valign="top">Really ghostly looking. Is that a person in the bottom window? Looks like someone walking away or something. If so, I wish I could see them a tiny bit more. I just say that because with all the white coming in it seems like it would be interesting to see something in the opposite color going in the other direction. Maybe that''s goofy but just a thought.</td>', 'Really ghostly looking. Is that a person in the bottom window? Looks like someone walking away or something. If so, I wish I could see them a tiny bit more. I just say that because with all the white coming in it seems like it would be interesting to see something in the opposite color going in the other direction. Maybe that''s goofy but just a thought.', '2012-11-22 14:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911418, 1042034, 140305, '<td valign="top">Almost cinqo (maybe that bud will open soon) Very pretty, love all the detail in the petals.</td>', 'Almost cinqo (maybe that bud will open soon) Very pretty, love all the detail in the petals.', '2012-11-22 14:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911419, 1041663, 140305, '<td valign="top">.....and still looks great. Nice photo.</td>', '.....and still looks great. Nice photo.', '2012-11-22 14:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911420, 1041641, 140305, '<td valign="top">Really admire the composition - such an interesting perspective.</td>', 'Really admire the composition - such an interesting perspective.', '2012-11-22 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911453, 1041955, 108991, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition!</td>', 'beautiful composition!', '2012-11-22 15:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911531, 1041455, 117037, '<td valign="top">Wonderful...10</td>', 'Wonderful...10', '2012-11-22 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911532, 1041524, 117037, '<td valign="top">Simple and brilliant...10!</td>', 'Simple and brilliant...10!', '2012-11-22 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911534, 1042025, 152252, '<td valign="top">Great light, texture, and shadows. That wall and negative look awesome. Love it. Got my 10</td>', 'Great light, texture, and shadows. That wall and negative look awesome. Love it. Got my 10', '2012-11-22 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911541, 1041756, 135697, '<td valign="top">nicely done! :O)</td>', 'nicely done! :O)', '2012-11-22 19:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911542, 1041870, 135697, '<td valign="top">great contrast! congrats!</td>', 'great contrast! congrats!', '2012-11-22 19:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911543, 1041524, 135697, '<td valign="top">really like this one! well done</td>', 'really like this one! well done', '2012-11-22 19:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911544, 1041955, 135697, '<td valign="top">great use of cantrast, love it</td>', 'great use of cantrast, love it', '2012-11-22 19:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911545, 1041948, 135697, '<td valign="top">a very beautiful image as well...</td>', 'a very beautiful image as well...', '2012-11-22 19:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911548, 1041679, 135697, '<td valign="top">great image and use of cantrast</td>', 'great image and use of cantrast', '2012-11-22 20:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911549, 1041639, 135697, '<td valign="top">also love this one! well done!</td>', 'also love this one! well done!', '2012-11-22 20:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911550, 1041904, 135697, '<td valign="top">part of me loves it part of me is unsure lolal but well done!</td>', 'part of me loves it part of me is unsure lolal but well done!', '2012-11-22 20:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911551, 1041919, 135697, '<td valign="top">interesting indeed!</td>', 'interesting indeed!', '2012-11-22 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911554, 1041817, 135697, '<td valign="top">the only thing i wondered was when this eclipse took part.. or whether that would be an issue on this challenge?? just curious... otherwise good entry... :)</td>', 'the only thing i wondered was when this eclipse took part.. or whether that would be an issue on this challenge?? just curious... otherwise good entry... :)', '2012-11-22 20:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911555, 1041685, 135697, '<td valign="top">i am intrigued by the title too...</td>', 'i am intrigued by the title too...', '2012-11-22 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911556, 1041824, 135697, '<td valign="top">love the image, I just wondered if you or anyone thinks it still needs a little something??</td>', 'love the image, I just wondered if you or anyone thinks it still needs a little something??', '2012-11-22 20:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911589, 1041958, 10785, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much better if the top of your head wasn''t showing! Raise those arms up a tad!! The processing and the shot/lighting are well done.</td>', 'This would have been so much better if the top of your head wasn''t showing! Raise those arms up a tad!! The processing and the shot/lighting are well done.', '2012-11-22 21:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911592, 1041915, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus on the eyes and nice B/W tones here with good contrast. A touch of an issue with composition created by cutting off the dog at the left side of the frame. Landscape orientation may have been better.</td>', 'Wonderful focus on the eyes and nice B/W tones here with good contrast. A touch of an issue with composition created by cutting off the dog at the left side of the frame. Landscape orientation may have been better.', '2012-11-22 21:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911593, 1041679, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the way the lines section off the shot. The contrast is so high the shot almost looks like a composite. I like the placement of the moon along with the gradient in the sky.</td>', 'I like the way the lines section off the shot. The contrast is so high the shot almost looks like a composite. I like the placement of the moon along with the gradient in the sky.', '2012-11-22 21:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911594, 1042012, 10785, '<td valign="top">The contrast is nicely shown in the water fountain. The rest of the image seems off color wise (sky, buildings) and contains some camera shake.</td>', 'The contrast is nicely shown in the water fountain. The rest of the image seems off color wise (sky, buildings) and contains some camera shake.', '2012-11-22 21:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911595, 1041994, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast light on the subject shows off the texture of the feathers well. I am not too fond of the background.</td>', 'Nice high contrast light on the subject shows off the texture of the feathers well. I am not too fond of the background.', '2012-11-22 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911596, 1041910, 10785, '<td valign="top">Playful framing!</td>', 'Playful framing!', '2012-11-22 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911597, 1041978, 10785, '<td valign="top">There is definitely contrast shown with the subject being in shade/diffuse light and the background being blown. However the subject is in diffuse, even, soft light so there are no major highlights/shadows to show off the texture of the feathers.</td>', 'There is definitely contrast shown with the subject being in shade/diffuse light and the background being blown. However the subject is in diffuse, even, soft light so there are no major highlights/shadows to show off the texture of the feathers.', '2012-11-22 21:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911599, 1042040, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting here is really soft and diffuse and even, rather than high contrast.</td>', 'I think the lighting here is really soft and diffuse and even, rather than high contrast.', '2012-11-22 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911601, 1041879, 10785, '<td valign="top">The lighting really has great contrast. I think you pushed it too far in post with the contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'The lighting really has great contrast. I think you pushed it too far in post with the contrast and sharpness.', '2012-11-22 21:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911602, 1041388, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasty light, however the focus is all on the background.</td>', 'Nice contrasty light, however the focus is all on the background.', '2012-11-22 21:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911603, 1041317, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. I think there was no need to show the sky here and a landscape orientation or square format may have worked better. Good contrast.</td>', 'Interesting capture. I think there was no need to show the sky here and a landscape orientation or square format may have worked better. Good contrast.', '2012-11-22 22:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911604, 1041379, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast shot, gritty and well done!</td>', 'Nice high contrast shot, gritty and well done!', '2012-11-22 22:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911621, 1041892, 114285, '<td valign="top">Pretty!</td>', 'Pretty!', '2012-11-22 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911706, 1042037, 108580, '<td valign="top">Hey Hombre ...now ask yourself did I shoot 5 or 6 shots?</td>', 'Hey Hombre ...now ask yourself did I shoot 5 or 6 shots?', '2012-11-23 01:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911716, 1041793, 108580, '<td valign="top">Perfect DMC. Stunning representation of form and function and light.</td>', 'Perfect DMC. Stunning representation of form and function and light.', '2012-11-23 01:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911717, 1042020, 108580, '<td valign="top">Love it. Excellent take on the challenge.</td>', 'Love it. Excellent take on the challenge.', '2012-11-23 01:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911718, 1041838, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous impression of the challenge. Great image.</td>', 'Fabulous impression of the challenge. Great image.', '2012-11-23 01:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911723, 1041954, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and photography. Perfect COLOR CONTRAST DMC.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and photography. Perfect COLOR CONTRAST DMC.', '2012-11-23 01:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911747, 1041994, 108580, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. DMC.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. DMC.', '2012-11-23 03:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911749, 1042005, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC, in a gritty and social commentary way.<br/>It always amazes me how theres still ''stuff'' untouched in abandoned buildings (and assume this is USA?). Here in Africa not even the walls would be left standing.</td>', 'DMC, in a gritty and social commentary way.It always amazes me how theres still ''stuff'' untouched in abandoned buildings (and assume this is USA?). Here in Africa not even the walls would be left standing.', '2012-11-23 03:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911770, 1042034, 114285, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but this is low key!</td>', 'Pretty, but this is low key!', '2012-11-23 04:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911772, 1041891, 114285, '<td valign="top">Fit''s the challenge, ticks the box!<br/> <br/>Does it impact me, ticks the box!<br/> <br/>Will it do well, only the voters can say!</td>', 'Fit''s the challenge, ticks the box! Does it impact me, ticks the box! Will it do well, only the voters can say!', '2012-11-23 04:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912043, 1041858, 68586, '<td valign="top">Delightful capture.</td>', 'Delightful capture.', '2012-11-23 16:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912045, 1041738, 152252, '<td valign="top">There is something really special to that picture. The lighting and the way you cropped it makes it pleasant to look at. B&amp;W is definitely a plus. 10</td>', 'There is something really special to that picture. The lighting and the way you cropped it makes it pleasant to look at. B&W is definitely a plus. 10', '2012-11-23 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912047, 1042001, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and composition - not decided about the frame.</td>', 'Nice colour and composition - not decided about the frame.', '2012-11-23 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912048, 1042037, 152252, '<td valign="top">Sempermarine? Great self portrait like always! :)</td>', 'Sempermarine? Great self portrait like always! :)', '2012-11-23 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912079, 1041617, 23484, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot. Great contrast.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot. Great contrast.', '2012-11-23 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912080, 1041685, 23484, '<td valign="top">That''s about as high contrast as you can get. Nice job.</td>', 'That''s about as high contrast as you can get. Nice job.', '2012-11-23 18:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
