(6913942, 1042037, 155989, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I like the gun but ...</td>', 'Can''t say I like the gun but ...', '2012-11-27 05:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6913944, 1041942, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a good take on the challenge, but as you have two strong linear features that are only slightly off vertical I find it slightly off-putting. I''d rather you had them either more diagonal or actually vertical.</td>', 'It''s a good take on the challenge, but as you have two strong linear features that are only slightly off vertical I find it slightly off-putting. I''d rather you had them either more diagonal or actually vertical.', '2012-11-27 05:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6913946, 1041472, 5364, '<td valign="top">In my opinion there''s potentially a great image here, but as it is I don''t find it that compelling. I think that the white isn''t bright enough. I also think that you could have cropped it much tighter at the top to make the image into three distinct areas - black/white/black.</td>', 'In my opinion there''s potentially a great image here, but as it is I don''t find it that compelling. I think that the white isn''t bright enough. I also think that you could have cropped it much tighter at the top to make the image into three distinct areas - black/white/black.', '2012-11-27 05:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6913947, 1041969, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but I think it needs a different crop - put more black between the flowers and the border at the top and bottom, and remove some of the black at the sides.</td>', 'I like the shot but I think it needs a different crop - put more black between the flowers and the border at the top and bottom, and remove some of the black at the sides.', '2012-11-27 05:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914018, 1041455, 155989, '<td valign="top">Just exquisite!</td>', 'Just exquisite!', '2012-11-27 09:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914020, 1041671, 155989, '<td valign="top">Oddly I think this image would have worked much better without the butterfly. The green tones are beautiful and it would have been a lovely abstract image. I think the high contrast detracts from the detail one expects to see on a macro photo and thus loses something, even though it makes the white spots on the butterfly body stand out.</td>', 'Oddly I think this image would have worked much better without the butterfly. The green tones are beautiful and it would have been a lovely abstract image. I think the high contrast detracts from the detail one expects to see on a macro photo and thus loses something, even though it makes the white spots on the butterfly body stand out.', '2012-11-27 09:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914028, 1041706, 23098, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo, great feel to it. Beautiful light &amp; contrast. Like the title too.  I know that smell, didn''t know it had a word.</td>', 'Really like this photo, great feel to it. Beautiful light & contrast. Like the title too.  I know that smell, didn''t know it had a word.', '2012-11-27 10:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
