(6914031, 1041958, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>Like I''ve mentioned before, you''re very dichotomous. A couple of the near recent challenges I killed you in voting. Not this one. It''s macabre and done exceptionally well. Giving you my top vote.<br/> <br/>Keep pushing the boundaries. You won''t always hit the ball, but those times you do, I really enjoy them.</td>', '#1Like I''ve mentioned before, you''re very dichotomous. A couple of the near recent challenges I killed you in voting. Not this one. It''s macabre and done exceptionally well. Giving you my top vote. Keep pushing the boundaries. You won''t always hit the ball, but those times you do, I really enjoy them.', '2012-11-27 10:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914033, 1041641, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another. <br/> <br/>Sweet potatoes, sweet image. Street photography done well will always get into my top three, or tied with some others. Unfortunately I like another entry a lot, so I had to push this down to second place.</td>', '#2, tied with another.  Sweet potatoes, sweet image. Street photography done well will always get into my top three, or tied with some others. Unfortunately I like another entry a lot, so I had to push this down to second place.', '2012-11-27 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
