(6914591, 1041685, 108069, '<td valign="top">Contrast: check. Very cool in a creeps me out at first but now I''m drawn to it kind of way. Nice.</td>', 'Contrast: check. Very cool in a creeps me out at first but now I''m drawn to it kind of way. Nice.', '2012-11-27 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914592, 1041437, 164, '<td valign="top">not enough contrast</td>', 'not enough contrast', '2012-11-27 22:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914593, 1041879, 164, '<td valign="top">conflicting patterns make this hard to look at.</td>', 'conflicting patterns make this hard to look at.', '2012-11-27 22:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914594, 1041832, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is high key, and frankly a bit OOF, I hope you enjoyed it though!</td>', 'This is high key, and frankly a bit OOF, I hope you enjoyed it though!', '2012-11-27 22:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914596, 1041646, 164, '<td valign="top">average pic of a cat</td>', 'average pic of a cat', '2012-11-27 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914597, 1041992, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pic and processing.</td>', 'Very interesting pic and processing.', '2012-11-27 22:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914599, 1041994, 114285, '<td valign="top">the bird is sharp but the background is highly distracting to make the bird stand out at all!</td>', 'the bird is sharp but the background is highly distracting to make the bird stand out at all!', '2012-11-27 23:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914600, 1041639, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely, and meets the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely, and meets the challenge.', '2012-11-27 23:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914601, 1041703, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but we see this all the time on here, not saying there is anything wrong with the theme at all, just over done :)</td>', 'Lovely, but we see this all the time on here, not saying there is anything wrong with the theme at all, just over done :)', '2012-11-27 23:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914602, 1041879, 114285, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened, I can see the pixels popping out!</td>', 'A bit oversharpened, I can see the pixels popping out!', '2012-11-27 23:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914603, 1041615, 114285, '<td valign="top">Poetically done!</td>', 'Poetically done!', '2012-11-27 23:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914604, 1041939, 114285, '<td valign="top">Whoahh this pops, what an interesting house, lol!</td>', 'Whoahh this pops, what an interesting house, lol!', '2012-11-27 23:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914605, 1041522, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s HC enough, and the spider is OOF!</td>', 'Not sure if it''s HC enough, and the spider is OOF!', '2012-11-27 23:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914606, 1041685, 114285, '<td valign="top">Interesting!</td>', 'Interesting!', '2012-11-27 23:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914607, 1041479, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is a bit low key I feel! Nice eyes though!</td>', 'This is a bit low key I feel! Nice eyes though!', '2012-11-27 23:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914609, 1041772, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wonderful as usual! Bump!</td>', 'Wonderful as usual! Bump!', '2012-11-27 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914610, 1041891, 96509, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a moment of pure emotion.</td>', 'Great capture of a moment of pure emotion.', '2012-11-27 23:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914611, 1041793, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is low key I feel!</td>', 'This is low key I feel!', '2012-11-27 23:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914612, 1042011, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones!</td>', 'Lovely tones!', '2012-11-27 23:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914613, 1041794, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cute, but does it really meet the challenge, I''ll let the voters decide, I gave you a 6.</td>', 'Cute, but does it really meet the challenge, I''ll let the voters decide, I gave you a 6.', '2012-11-27 23:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914615, 1041910, 114285, '<td valign="top">Way over saturated, nice couple though!</td>', 'Way over saturated, nice couple though!', '2012-11-27 23:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914616, 1041952, 96509, '<td valign="top">I really like how the shadows of the blinds are well defined all across the subject, hat, face and t-shirt.</td>', 'I really like how the shadows of the blinds are well defined all across the subject, hat, face and t-shirt.', '2012-11-27 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914617, 1041553, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sublime tones and soothing. I want to pull up a seat and wait however long without care just to watch the story. I love this.</td>', 'Sublime tones and soothing. I want to pull up a seat and wait however long without care just to watch the story. I love this.', '2012-11-27 23:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914619, 1041884, 96509, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel the music, great capture.</td>', 'I can almost feel the music, great capture.', '2012-11-27 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914620, 1041952, 108069, '<td valign="top">Contrast everywhere. Cool photo, and cooler hat!</td>', 'Contrast everywhere. Cool photo, and cooler hat!', '2012-11-27 23:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914623, 1042025, 96509, '<td valign="top">I feel there are too many distracting elements here, the wooden, shadows, ceiling, took me a while to realize that there were negatives there. Maybe a shallower DOF would have worked better?</td>', 'I feel there are too many distracting elements here, the wooden, shadows, ceiling, took me a while to realize that there were negatives there. Maybe a shallower DOF would have worked better?', '2012-11-27 23:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914624, 1041922, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sci-fi feel for sure. Nicely composed and interesting contrast on both the small scale (side of the hill) and the big picture (silhouettes against the sky).</td>', 'Sci-fi feel for sure. Nicely composed and interesting contrast on both the small scale (side of the hill) and the big picture (silhouettes against the sky).', '2012-11-27 23:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914625, 1042018, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great design created entirely by contrast. Well spotted and well done.</td>', 'Great design created entirely by contrast. Well spotted and well done.', '2012-11-27 23:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914627, 1041720, 96509, '<td valign="top">For some reason I get the impression that the back of her head is too flat, somewhat odd and distracting. But probably is just me... Her expression looks very natural and sincere, I like it.</td>', 'For some reason I get the impression that the back of her head is too flat, somewhat odd and distracting. But probably is just me... Her expression looks very natural and sincere, I like it.', '2012-11-27 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914628, 1041969, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2012-11-27 23:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914629, 1041956, 96509, '<td valign="top">This brings so many nice memories back, thanks. Love the shot.</td>', 'This brings so many nice memories back, thanks. Love the shot.', '2012-11-27 23:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914633, 1041983, 108069, '<td valign="top">Truly cinematic. Amazing stories are all around us and I feel as though I''ve just caught a glimpse of something special. Standout.</td>', 'Truly cinematic. Amazing stories are all around us and I feel as though I''ve just caught a glimpse of something special. Standout.', '2012-11-27 23:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914635, 1041615, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nice tones, excellent title, well done.</td>', 'Very cool. Nice tones, excellent title, well done.', '2012-11-27 23:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914636, 1041920, 96509, '<td valign="top">I love the body language in this one, his fully extended arms and lower head transmit a sensation of fatigue/resignation. I find the title not be quite in accordance with the feeling on the image, although cultural differences and wrong preconceptions are probably misleading my interpretation.</td>', 'I love the body language in this one, his fully extended arms and lower head transmit a sensation of fatigue/resignation. I find the title not be quite in accordance with the feeling on the image, although cultural differences and wrong preconceptions are probably misleading my interpretation.', '2012-11-27 23:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914637, 1041700, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and execution. Nice stuff.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and execution. Nice stuff.', '2012-11-27 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914638, 1041620, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2012-11-27 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914639, 1041706, 108069, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, but I can''t place it in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the photo, but I can''t place it in the challenge.', '2012-11-27 23:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914642, 1041738, 108069, '<td valign="top">I love the empty space in this. Excellent tones, crisp whites vs. the darkness. One of my favorites.</td>', 'I love the empty space in this. Excellent tones, crisp whites vs. the darkness. One of my favorites.', '2012-11-27 23:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914643, 1041948, 96509, '<td valign="top">I found that the lack of detail on her face make the image too flat. The black things are such a contrast with the lack of detail of the skin that appear disconnected and fake. The eyes also get a bit lost with the strong highlights of the skin.</td>', 'I found that the lack of detail on her face make the image too flat. The black things are such a contrast with the lack of detail of the skin that appear disconnected and fake. The eyes also get a bit lost with the strong highlights of the skin.', '2012-11-27 23:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914644, 1042029, 114285, '<td valign="top">I find this to be more low key, than high contrast, lovely bokeh though!</td>', 'I find this to be more low key, than high contrast, lovely bokeh though!', '2012-11-27 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914645, 1041915, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cute dog, but this is DNMC! 5</td>', 'Cute dog, but this is DNMC! 5', '2012-11-27 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914646, 1042025, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Very, very cool.</td>', 'Very cool. Very, very cool.', '2012-11-27 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914647, 1041645, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely mist, but not meeting the challenge entirely! 5</td>', 'Lovely mist, but not meeting the challenge entirely! 5', '2012-11-27 23:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914648, 1041679, 96509, '<td valign="top">Man, I find that street light annoying.... I would have liked so much more without it, but I guess there was no way of avoiding it. Street shots are like that. Nice wall though.</td>', 'Man, I find that street light annoying.... I would have liked so much more without it, but I guess there was no way of avoiding it. Street shots are like that. Nice wall though.', '2012-11-27 23:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914649, 1041720, 114285, '<td valign="top">Way overprocessed!</td>', 'Way overprocessed!', '2012-11-27 23:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914650, 1041738, 114285, '<td valign="top">Bit on the low key side I feel!</td>', 'Bit on the low key side I feel!', '2012-11-27 23:29:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6914651, 1041620, 96509, '<td valign="top">Her pose seem quite unnatural to me, her expression seem too empty and flat of emotion. I would have preferable a stronger attitude. Not quite fan of the shadow either.</td>', 'Her pose seem quite unnatural to me, her expression seem too empty and flat of emotion. I would have preferable a stronger attitude. Not quite fan of the shadow either.', '2012-11-27 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914653, 1041685, 96509, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred having the eyes in a more central composition the moth and nostrils appear to be only distracting from very interesting eyes.</td>', 'I would have preferred having the eyes in a more central composition the moth and nostrils appear to be only distracting from very interesting eyes.', '2012-11-27 23:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914654, 1042037, 108069, '<td valign="top">The King swims! Well done, again. Cool photo.</td>', 'The King swims! Well done, again. Cool photo.', '2012-11-27 23:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914656, 1041756, 138630, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective here.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I really like the perspective here.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914657, 1041437, 138630, '<td valign="top">A fine portrait of this majestic bird.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'A fine portrait of this majestic bird.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914658, 1041617, 138630, '<td valign="top">Brilliant late day autumn colors - nice scene.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Brilliant late day autumn colors - nice scene.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914659, 1041954, 138630, '<td valign="top">When?<br/>Nice light and great colors and lines.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'When?Nice light and great colors and lines.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914660, 1041838, 108069, '<td valign="top">Quite cool. Nice detail and excellent lighting.</td>', 'Quite cool. Nice detail and excellent lighting.', '2012-11-27 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914662, 1041756, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and nice extremes in tones and lighting.</td>', 'Great perspective and nice extremes in tones and lighting.', '2012-11-27 23:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914663, 1041983, 138630, '<td valign="top">The colors and clarity are beautiful but the size difference is disorienting.  I feel as if I''m looking at a giantess and given the sweet, youthful appearance of the silhouette, that is not quite working for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The colors and clarity are beautiful but the size difference is disorienting.  I feel as if I''m looking at a giantess and given the sweet, youthful appearance of the silhouette, that is not quite working for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914666, 1041956, 138630, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the high contrast, the pov, the setting.  Wish his torso was against a lighter area, though.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I appreciate the high contrast, the pov, the setting.  Wish his torso was against a lighter area, though.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914667, 1041645, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and depth to it cutting through the mist.</td>', 'Lovely light and depth to it cutting through the mist.', '2012-11-27 23:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914668, 1041952, 138630, '<td valign="top">The stripes are interesting but they also make for a very busy image.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The stripes are interesting but they also make for a very busy image.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914671, 1042019, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  I think because it is so simple and real.  Beautiful capture of light.</td>', 'I like this one.  I think because it is so simple and real.  Beautiful capture of light.', '2012-11-27 23:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914672, 1041524, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Cool idea and very well done.</td>', 'Nice one. Cool idea and very well done.', '2012-11-27 23:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914673, 1041379, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hello Bill.  He has an interesting expression.  Are those white tips on his eyelashes?</td>', 'Hello Bill.  He has an interesting expression.  Are those white tips on his eyelashes?', '2012-11-27 23:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914676, 1041510, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalistic shot. Nice washed out tones except for those sharp pops of contrast. Very cool.</td>', 'Nice minimalistic shot. Nice washed out tones except for those sharp pops of contrast. Very cool.', '2012-11-27 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914678, 1041973, 114285, '<td valign="top">Amazing truly amazing shot, best one by far, and yeah meets the challenge unlike a lot of others which don''t!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Amazing truly amazing shot, best one by far, and yeah meets the challenge unlike a lot of others which don''t! ', '2012-11-27 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914679, 1042025, 114285, '<td valign="top">A marvel to look at! Bump to a 9.</td>', 'A marvel to look at! Bump to a 9.', '2012-11-27 23:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914680, 1041524, 138630, '<td valign="top">Definitely high contrast - exposure is very well handled and I like the texture.  Not very interesting to me, though.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Definitely high contrast - exposure is very well handled and I like the texture.  Not very interesting to me, though.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-27 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914681, 1041824, 138630, '<td valign="top">I think this is very beautiful - I wonder whether the tones, while lovely, are hurting it in the challenge.  Voted earlier.<br/>Bumped.  I think this would have shouted high contrast in black and white so the contrast should be the same here.</td>', 'I think this is very beautiful - I wonder whether the tones, while lovely, are hurting it in the challenge.  Voted earlier.Bumped.  I think this would have shouted high contrast in black and white so the contrast should be the same here.', '2012-11-27 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914682, 1041803, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too intense for me. Well done, for sure, but quite intense. Contrast is here as well. Expertly done with the lighting.</td>', 'This is a bit too intense for me. Well done, for sure, but quite intense. Contrast is here as well. Expertly done with the lighting.', '2012-11-27 23:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914683, 1041663, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Excellent.</td>', 'Great portrait. Excellent.', '2012-11-27 23:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6914684, 1042005, 108069, '<td valign="top">Draws me in.</td>', 'Draws me in.', '2012-11-27 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
