(6914976, 1042010, 67152, '<td valign="top">Richard, yet another wonderful ram shot!  <br/> <br/>While I agree with you that it is high contrast at the micro level, the extent of the textures throughout created by the background and the coat of the animal give the image a decidedly gray feel on the larger scale.  Hence, it comes across as lower contrast because there are not large sections of dark and light to provide the overt contrast viewers expected.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-28 08:28:51.</i></td>', 'Richard, yet another wonderful ram shot!   While I agree with you that it is high contrast at the micro level, the extent of the textures throughout created by the background and the coat of the animal give the image a decidedly gray feel on the larger scale.  Hence, it comes across as lower contrast because there are not large sections of dark and light to provide the overt contrast viewers expected.', '2012-11-28 08:28:13.000000', '2012-11-28 08:28:51.000000', 0),
