(6915219, 1041838, 96509, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the votes and comments. <br/> <br/>@mefnj, this was my first successful attempt to photograph smoke. There are several tutorials all around on how to do it even in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=59" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DPC_Tuto</a>.<br/>I don''t have an external flash and I don''t let my self to spend more money on gear until I settle somewhere so in this case I use the built-in flash of the camera. Luckily, it was good enough.<br/> <br/>@tanguera, Thanks for your comment, I don''t seem to handle borders properly always end up second guessing how big, what color if to use or not to use.... Haven''t developed an artistic eyes for them yet, hopefully I manage to get it soon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-28 13:08:38.</i></td>', 'Thanks all for the votes and comments.  @mefnj, this was my first successful attempt to photograph smoke. There are several tutorials all around on how to do it even in DPC_Tuto.I don''t have an external flash and I don''t let my self to spend more money on gear until I settle somewhere so in this case I use the built-in flash of the camera. Luckily, it was good enough. @tanguera, Thanks for your comment, I don''t seem to handle borders properly always end up second guessing how big, what color if to use or not to use.... Haven''t developed an artistic eyes for them yet, hopefully I manage to get it soon.', '2012-11-28 13:08:19.000000', '2012-11-28 13:08:38.000000', 0),
(6915221, 1042018, 138630, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Marcia.  I love staircase patterns and images of them and this is a great one.  Congrats on the personal best, too.</td>', 'Congratulations, Marcia.  I love staircase patterns and images of them and this is a great one.  Congrats on the personal best, too.', '2012-11-28 13:08:30.000000', NULL, 0),
