(6915602, 1041620, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Epsi:</b></div><hr/><i> Her pose seem quite unnatural to me, her expression seem too empty and flat of emotion. I would have preferable a stronger attitude. Not quite fan of the shadow either. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Funny, the shadow is what made the shot for me, it almost seems to take on a life of it''s own.</td>', 'Originally posted by Epsi: Her pose seem quite unnatural to me, her expression seem too empty and flat of emotion. I would have preferable a stronger attitude. Not quite fan of the shadow either.   Funny, the shadow is what made the shot for me, it almost seems to take on a life of it''s own.', '2012-11-29 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
